als relating to the exported project filesystem, but I can't seem to find them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469194222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2469783655","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99047#issuecomment-2469783655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99047","id":2469783655,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TNehn","user":{"login":"BrianBHuynh","id":51097402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDk3NDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51097402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh","html_url":"https://github.com/BrianBHuynh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrianBHuynh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T07:27:29Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T07:27:29Z","body":"Thanks for the clarification o7 I think a warning being shot out when using diraccess get_files and etc might be a good idea then if the prefix is res","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co